      ],
      "devanagari": "शक्तिद्वयं च चिक्षेप कंकालं मुसलं तथा |\nवैद्याधरं महास्त्रं च कालास्त्रमथ दारुणम्",
      "iast": "śakti dvayam ca cikṣepa kaṅkālam musalam tathā |\nvaidyādharam mahāas.htram ca kālāstram atha dāruṇam",
      "translation": "\"A pair of powers are launched, namely Power of Vishnu and the Power of Rudra, like that the Impeller, Crowbar, and a great missile called Staggerer, and then he launched the lethal missile of the Time.",
