          "iast": "tat adbhutam iva abhavat",
          "devanagari": "तत् अद्भुतं इव अभवत्",
          "meaning": "[all] that, spectacle, like, it became.",
          "anvayaIndex": 7,
          "verseIndex": null
        }
      ]
