      "label": "1.56.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "तानि सर्वाणि दण्डेन ग्रसते ब्रह्मणः सुतः\nतेषु शांतेषु ब्रह्मास्त्रं क्षिप्तवान् गाधिनंदनः |",
      "iast": "tāni sar.hvāṇi daṇḍena grasate brahmaṇaḥ sutaḥ\nteṣu śānteṣu brahmās.htram kṣiptavān gādhi nandanaḥ |",
      "translation": "\"Brahma's son Vashishta defused all of those missiles just with his baton and when all of them are thus silenced, Gaadhi's son Vishvamitra touched off Brahma's missile.",
