      "label": "1.56.14, 15",
      "numbers": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "तदस्त्रमुद्यतं दृष्ट्वा देवाः साग्निपुरोगमाः\nदेवर्षयश्च संभ्रांता गंधर्वाः समहोरगाः |\nत्रैलोक्यमासीत् संत्रस्तं ब्रह्मास्त्रे समुदीरिते",
      "iast": "tat as.htram udyatam dṛṣṭvā devāḥ sa agni purogamāḥ\ndeva ṛṣayaḥ ca sambhrāntā gandharvāḥ sa mahā uragāḥ |\ntrailokyam āsīt santrastam brahmās.htre samudīrite",
      "translation": "\"When Vishvamitra brandished and set up Brahma missile for launching, seeing it all the gods keeping the Fire-god at their vanguard, godly sages, reptiles along with gandharva-s are perplexed, and the triad of worlds itself is perturbed.",
