    {
      "id": "1.56.18",
      "label": "1.56.18",
      "numbers": [
        18
      ],
      "devanagari": "रोमकूपेषु सर्वेषु वसिष्ठस्य महात्मनः |\nमरीच्य इव निष्पेतुरग्नेर्धूमाकुलार्चिषः",
      "iast": "roma kūpeṣu sarveṣu vasiṣṭhasya mahātmanaḥ |\nmarīcya iva niṣpetuḥ agneḥ dhūma ākula arciṣaḥ",
      "translation": "\"From all of the pits of hair of that great-souled Vashishta ramified are the raditional beams and those radiated shafts are rolling up with the fumes of radiation, so to speak.",
